ŋena ta la, matso azɔ.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Maɖe wo tso ame siwo le vlo dom wo la ƒe asi me.”","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Kpɔtsɔtsɔ mele Yehowa ƒe nyawo ŋuti o,","poem":1},{"text":"wole abe klosalo si wololo le anyikpo me,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"eye wòdza zi gbɔ zi adre la ene.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Ame vɔ̃ɖiwo zɔna le ablɔɖe me,","poem":1},{"text":"eye wodea bubu yakanuwɔwɔwo ŋu le amegbetɔwo dome.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"O! Yehowa, àna míanɔ dedie,","poem":1},{"text":"eye àdzɔ mía ŋu tso ame siawo tɔgbi ƒe asi me tegbetegbe.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/ewe_bib/PSA/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/ewe_bib/PSA/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/ewe_bib/PSA/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}